      "descriptions": {
        "shortDescriptionText": "<p>Discover a boatload of rowdy pirate fun and some raucous pirate activities aboard this authentic pirate ship.</p>",
        "shortDescriptionMobileText": "Avast, ye mateys! Captain Jack invites you to experience pirate life first-hand when ye climb aboard this legendary vessel for rousing pirate games, activities and hands-on fun."
      },
      "entityCards": [
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Come Aboard… If Ye Dare",
              "text": "<p>The Treasure Cove pirates be seeking cutthroat crewmates to join their marauding high-seas adventures. Have ye the pluck and cunning to set sail with this band of villainous rascals and rogues?</p>\n<p>Roam the decks of Siren’s Revenge and discover hands-on (or hooks-on) pirating activities, experiences and games that will test your prowess. See if ye have the sea legs, fearless heart, steady hand and adventurous spirit to be a buccaneer!</p>\n<p>But keep a keen eye out, me mateys. When this wily pirate crew returns to the ship, high-flying mayhem and mischief—in the form of a reckless and rambunctious stunt show—are never far behind!</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-sirens-revenge-01-new_tcm1871-114860.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "A Ship Laden with Legend and Lore",
              "text": "<p>Today, Treasure Cove is a high-spirited, rollicking pirate haven—and it’s all thanks to Siren’s Revenge! So come explore the ship that’s a proud part of pirate history.</p>\n<p>Originally a Spanish ship, Siren’s Revenge was commandeered by one Joshamee Gibbs—a good friend of Captain Jack—and became a vital asset to their pirating enterprises. But when the English Navy took control of Treasure Cove and its fortress, they tried to drive these buccaneers from the local waters.</p>\n<p>To rid themselves of the pesky British once and for all, Gibbs and Captain Jack concocted a masterful scheme: while the ship’s cannons bombarded the fortress, a landing party paddling a fleet of <a href=\"https://www.shanghaidisneyresort.com/attractions/explorer-canoes/\">Explorer Canoes</a> furtively stormed the shore and routed the scurvy knave Brits.</p>\n<p>For now, the ship is moored peacefully at Landlubber’s Landing so visitors can board and get a taste of pirating life. Be ready though—at any moment, when treasure or adventure call, Siren’s Revenge may once more hoist its sails and set a course for the open seas!</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-sirens-revenge-02-new_tcm1871-114861.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cardType": "buttonCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Shipwreck Shore",
              "text": "Just moments from Landlubber Landing, explore and frolic at this interactive waterfront playground created out of a shipwrecked French galleon.",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-sirens-revenge-03-new_tcm1871-114862.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ],
              "buttonCardUrl": "https://www.shanghaidisneyresort.com/en/experience/attraction/shipwreck-shore"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
